les\", \"just the Trerio ones\", \"what time is the goblet thing\", \"can u get the sieve photo back out of the bin\"], [\"starred files?\", \"only Trerio\", \"goblet thing — what time?\", \"restore the sieve photo\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0003\", \"v\": [[\"show me the pics i took recently\", \"photos from recently pls\"], [\"pics taken recently\", \"recently taken photos?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0004\", \"v\": [[\"umm so I, uh, Fosbaen — I phoned them today, can you log that?\", \"oh, it was, um, Halvorsen. That one.\", \"ok so different thing… do I have any photos of Shethie Venkatesan?\", \"hang on, wait — what's, um, what's still left to do about the beacon?\", \"oh and, uh, the safe code is 98058 — can you keep that in the locker?\"], [\"I've been trying to keep better track of who I talk to, so could you note that I spoke to Fosbaen today — I phoned them this afternoon.\", \"Sorry, should've been clearer — it was Halvorsen, the one I actually called.\", \"Totally unrelated, but I'm putting together a little something for a friend, so do I have any photos of Shethie Venkatesan?\", \"Hang on, before I forget, because it's been nagging at me all week — what's left for me to do about the beacon?\", \"Last thing, I keep forgetting it every time I need it: the safe code is 98058, so could you put it in the locker for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0005\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to be better about keeping in touch with people, and I just got off a call — I phoned Fosbaen Jayasuriya today, so could you log that for me?\"], [\"Could you please log that I phoned Fosbaen Jayasuriya today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0007\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a free afternoon and I'd like to actually get some things done for once, so what's still left on my to-do list?\"], [\"Could you please tell me what's still left on my to-do list?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0008\", \"v\": [[\"whats in my calendar friday\", \"whos coming to the radish one\", \"and this week?\", \"eh forget it\", \"the drama one, who else is gonna be there\", \"and sunday?\"], [\"I'm trying to figure out if I can squeeze in a dentist appointment, so what's in my calendar for friday?\", \"That radish one — I can never remember if it's a group thing, so who's actually coming to it?\", \"And while we're at it, since I'm planning the next few days anyway, what about this week?\", \"Actually, you know what, I've changed my mind, just forget it.\", \"Hmm, about the drama one though — I'd like to know who else will be there before I commit to going.\", \"And the same thing for sunday? I'm just trying to get a sense of who I'll be seeing.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0009\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you, uh, get rid of every biscuit to-do? all of them\"], [\"delete every biscuit to-do\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0010\", \"v\": [[\"anything happening friday\", \"move the second one to sunday and cancel the third pls\"], [\"ok so, um, is there anything going on friday?\", \"right, uh, can you move the second one to sunday and — and cancel the third one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0011\", \"v\": [[\"notes in Astrophotography notebook — how many?\", \"Trerio router password details\", \"password on it?\", \"astrophotography notes\", \"Zibocombe 2027 album pics\", \"just last week\"], [\"Could you tell me how many notes I have in my Astrophotography notebook, please?\", \"Separately, would you mind showing me the details for the Trerio router password?\", \"Could you tell me what the password on it actually is, please?\", \"On another matter, could you please find my notes about astrophotography?\", \"Would you mind showing me which pictures are in the Zibocombe 2027 album?\", \"Could you narrow those down to only the ones from last week, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0012\", \"v\": [[\"umm so for the Zibocombe trip, uh… how much have I spent on it so far?\"], [\"Zibocombe trip how much have i spent\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0013\", \"v\": [[\"ok so, um, what've I been spending on in the Zibocombe trip? like what are the expenses?\"], [\"I'm trying to settle up with everyone before we forget the details, so could you show me what I've spent money on in the Zibocombe trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0016\", \"v\": [[\"umm what time's the, uh, the oatmeal sale?\", \"oh and — and the Vruvie?\"], [\"what time is the oatmeal sale\", \"and the Vruvie?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0017\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a card sorted out early this year, so could you tell me when Fosbaen's birthday is?\", \"Actually, going by what you had, could I get the contact details for the fourth one? I'd like to reach them directly.\", \"Completely different thing, I've been meaning to plan around it — when is the windsurfing business happening?\", \"Also, I'm trying to work out how many snacks to bring, so who's invited to the fair?\", \"Last one, I'm curious how many I actually took on that trip — can you count the pictures from Zibocombe?\"], [\"Fosbaen's birthday?\", \"fourth one's contact details\", \"windsurfing thing — when?\", \"who's invited to the fair\", \"count Zibocombe pics\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I was telling a friend about the snowy weekend we had at the start of the year, so could you show me the shots from January?\", \"Oh nice, I've been building up a little collection — could you put the first one in the Radish progress album?\"], [\"umm can you show me the, uh, the shots from January?\", \"ok and, um, put the first one in the Radish progress album?\"]]}","ttft_ms":10157,"type":"result","duration_ms":29894,"uuid":"af02fb67-111a-4015-914c-20d1391d79d9","ttft_stream_ms":1286,"time_to_request_ms":137,"first_content_frame_ms":1286,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22461878,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279012250.9097,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
